    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about Yasuke, an otaku trapped inside the game Yasuke: My Legendary Samurai, who must defeat five powerful bosses across five different stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat focuses entirely on boss battles, inspired by Soulslike games such as <i>Sekiro</i>, combined with stylized anime visuals reminiscent of popular RPGs like <i>Persona</i> and <i>Metaphor: ReFantazio</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please Note:</strong> This is not a Soulslike game. It is an action game with a combat system (e.g., stamina-based) inspired by the Soulslike genre.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about Yasuke, an otaku trapped inside the game Yasuke: My Legendary Samurai, who must defeat five powerful bosses across five different stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat focuses entirely on boss battles, inspired by Soulslike games such as <i>Sekiro</i>, combined with stylized anime visuals reminiscent of popular RPGs like <i>Persona</i> and <i>Metaphor: ReFantazio</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please Note:</strong> This is not a Soulslike game. It is an action game with a combat system (e.g., stamina-based) inspired by the Soulslike genre.</p>",
    "short_description": "He just wanted a cool Yasuke game\u2014but ended up trapped in a cheap rip-off his mom bought by mistake. Now, the only way to escape and refund it is to defeat five tough bosses in stamina-based, Soulslike-inspired combat with anime-style visuals.",
